  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 375°f (190°c).",
    "cook lasagne sheets according to package instructions.",
    "in a pan, heat tadka oil over medium heat.",
    "add chopped onion, grated ginger, and minced garlic.",
    "cook until onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "add turmeric, cumin, chopped green chilies, salt, and pepper.",
    "cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add cooked chicken breast and stir to combine.",
    "layer cooked lasagne sheets, chicken mixture, and shredded cheese in a baking dish.",
    "cover with foil and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "remove foil and bake for an additional 10 minutes, or until cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
